          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a slightly smaller hook than for standard dc at this yarn weight; the extra tightness helps the cover hold its shape. Around 500 m total for both panels."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
